ore_item_assets/steam/apps/2657540/extras/c393690fe3d3a05a926655dbd24cf582.webm?t=1719685866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657540/extras/c393690fe3d3a05a926655dbd24cf582.mp4?t=1719685866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As the waves increase, be prepared to face tougher enemies. Brace yourself to fight the final Battleship at wave 15!<br><br>This game also features:<br>- High replayability<br>- Tracked statistics<br>- Unlockable hard mode<br><br>To play the game, you need to use a mouse and a keyboard. Controllers are not supported.<br><br>I hope you like it!",
